        <h3 data-id="pg102_n0005" class="adt-h3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900">Situata 1.</h3>
      </div>

      <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
        <span data-id="pg102_n0007">Familja Gashi kishte dal&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ta kaluar fundjav&#xeb;n n&#xeb; qytetin e Prizrenit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0008">H&#xeb;na, 10-vje&#xe7;are, po e shijonte shum&#xeb; at&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tim.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0009">Kureshtja e saj u shtua kur pa gjith&#xeb; ato nd&#xeb;rtesa t&#xeb; vjetra: muze, kala dhe vende q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;sonin denj&#xeb;sisht kultur&#xeb;n e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0010">E kush tjet&#xeb;r do t&#xeb; mund t&#x2019;i jepte p&#xeb;rgjigje m&#xeb; t&#xeb; sakta sesa babai i saj, zejtar n&#xeb; qytetin e Gjakov&#xeb;s!</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0011">- Babi, a mund t&#xeb; m&#xeb; tregosh prap&#xeb; se &#xe7;ka konsiderohet trash&#xeb;gimi kulturore?</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0012">- Po, H&#xeb;na.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0013">T&#xeb; gjitha parqet natyrore, galerit&#xeb; e artit, kalat&#xeb;, kullat, sht&#xeb;pit&#xeb; e vjetra, monumentet fetare, rrugicat e ngushta, shat&#xeb;rvan&#xeb;t dhe shum&#xeb; objekte t&#xeb; tjera jan&#xeb; elemente q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;si t&#xeb; madhe p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e kultur&#xeb;s dhe t&#xeb; tradit&#xeb;s shqiptare.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0014">- T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to q&#xeb; i p&#xeb;rmende qenkan objekte.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0015">A ka edhe gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; tjera q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore?</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0016">- Po, sigurisht.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0017">Trash&#xeb;gimia jomateriale p&#xeb;rfshin gjuh&#xeb;n dhe krijimtarit&#xeb; popullore.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0018">- Cilat jan&#xeb; disa nga monumentet kryesore arkeologjike?</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0019">- Mund t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmendim qytetin e lasht&#xeb; t&#xeb; Ulpian&#xeb;s, Manastirin e De&#xe7;anit dhe Sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0020">Kosova ka edhe shum&#xeb; muze.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0021">Veshjet dhe gatimet tradicionale q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rcillen brez pas brezi jan&#xeb; mjaft unike.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0022">- E mrekullueshme.</span>
        <span data-id="pg102_n0023">Mezi po pres q&#xeb; p&#xeb;r gj&#xeb;rat q&#xeb; m&#xeb;sova sot, t&#xeb; bisedoj me shok&#xeb;t dhe m&#xeb;suesen n&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;.</span>
      </p>
